+### Native nonce modes
 
+Parallel replay domains belong in the frame transaction because replay protection and payment approval are one atomic protocol transition. A contract-managed nullifier table cannot provide the same guarantee: `VERIFY` is static-call-like, while a later ordinary frame can revert after payment approval has already committed.
